        "content": "Exit code 1\n  192.168.20.1           c0-6f-98-3e-b0-d2     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.119         f8-54-b8-73-1d-8b     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.150         54-b2-03-94-64-da     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.197         10-dd-b1-a9-a0-11     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.239         6e-4b-75-94-02-ca     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.24          90-dd-5d-d9-6d-9f     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.30          86-5a-d2-61-60-07     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.36          7e-5e-56-13-dd-3d     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.38          d8-c4-97-c2-7a-2c     dynamic   \n  192.168.20.53          20-ef-bd-66-58-ea     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.62          44-ac-85-9e-77-72     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.63          00-71-47-8b-a7-23     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.64          44-ac-85-9d-e5-12     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.65          60-f4-19-00-12-12     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.66          d4-3f-32-9e-57-52     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.67          c0-6f-98-83-17-d2     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.68          00-9c-02-8f-e1-91     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.71          f4-4d-30-17-50-63     dynamic   \n  192.168.21.73          da-c7-a4-77-08-48     dynamic   \n===LINK-FLAP-EVENTS===",
